msgstr "votre transporteur"

#. placeholders: {money_text}, {former}
msgid ""
"You owed {money_text}, which is more than {former} carries on a driver, and "
"they have ended your employment."
msgstr ""
"Vous deviez {money_text}, plus que ce que {former} accepte pour un "
"chauffeur, et ils ont mis fin à votre emploi."

msgid ""
"That balance is closed. You do not owe it to anyone any more, and your cash "
"is back to zero."
msgstr ""
"Ce solde est clos. Vous ne le devez plus à personne, et votre trésorerie "
"est revenue à zéro."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Once your dispatch trust is full again, Business status lets you move to "
"another carrier."
msgstr ""
"Une fois votre confiance du dispatch revenue au maximum, Situation de "
"l'entreprise vous permet de changer de transporteur."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "What changes is the seat."
msgstr "Ce qui change, c'est la place au volant."

#. placeholders: {former}, {LAST_CHANCE_CARRIER_NAME}
msgid ""
"What changes is the seat. Your assigned tractor goes back to the {former} "
"yard, and you go on the payroll at {LAST_CHANCE_CARRIER_NAME}: shorter "
"freight, lower pay, and equipment to match. Once your dispatch trust is "
"full again, Business status lets you move to another carrier."
msgstr ""
"Ce qui change, c'est la place au volant. Votre tracteur attribué retourne "
"au dépôt de {former}, et vous êtes embauché chez {LAST_CHANCE_CARRIER_NAME} "
": du fret plus court, une paie plus basse, et le matériel qui va avec. Une "
"fois votre confiance du dispatch revenue au maximum, Situation de "
"l'entreprise vous permet de changer de transporteur."

#. placeholders: {former}, {LAST_CHANCE_CARRIER_NAME}
#. one sentence of a longer line
